{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"records\": [\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"S182-single-b\",\n      \"candidateHash\": \"9f9819b583ce8b1b52946733f10090349fef4d6b84df1990d6bc01bb0a07ba7a\",\n      \"secondPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\n            \"score\": 5,\n            \"evidence\": \"A1 invokes thirty years of dues and the club's promise; A5 repeats 'We look after our own' while struggling to include himself.\"\n          },\n          \"responseLogic\": {\n            \"score\": 5,\n            \"evidence\": \"B2's reassigned locker prompts A3 to seek recognition of his membership history; B4's bag offer becomes A5's request for the crest.\"\n          },\n          \"relationship\": {\n            \"score\": 4,\n            \"evidence\": \"B2 needs the locker key and B4 has already checked with the club, making B a constrained intermediary rather than merely an antagonist.\"\n          },\n          \"heightening\": {\n            \"score\": 4,\n            \"evidence\": \"After B4 confirms that removal is proceeding, A5 transfers his hope from retaining the locker to receiving a branded bag.\"\n          },\n          \"specificity\": {\n            \"score\": 5,\n            \"evidence\": \"A1's thirty-year membership, B2's locker key and A5's club crest give the actors concrete history, business and a playable loss.\"\n          },\n          \"brevityWit\": {\n            \"score\": 4,\n            \"evidence\": \"A5's crest request makes the club's removal bag carry its promise of belonging; 'one of those' lands through A's slipping confidence.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"weightedTotal\": 92\n      },\n      \"hardGates\": {\n        \"fiveSpokenTurns\": true,\n        \"aHoldsRequestedCard\": true,\n        \"b2CausesA3\": true,\n        \"b4CausesA5\": true,\n        \"noSeparateNarration\": true,\n        \"noUnrelatedPunchline\": true,\n        \"noRealPartnerInstruction\": true,\n        \"noForcedEnding\": true\n      },\n      \"hardGateEvidence\": {\n        \"b2CausesA3\": \"B2 reveals that the locker has been rented away; A3 asks B to check the thirty years of membership as grounds for a respectful explanation.\",\n        \"b4CausesA5\": \"B4 reports that the only concession is a bag; A5 accepts that object and asks for the club crest to preserve symbolic membership.\",\n        \"cardContribution\": \"A1 and A5 use the club's old promise sincerely, while A3's trust in a respectful explanation deteriorates into A5's uncertain claim to belong.\",\n        \"sameGameHeightened\": \"A5 tries to find the institution's promise in the very object supplied to remove him, deepening the established dependence on its old language.\"\n      },\n      \"reservation\": \"A3's 'check my thirty years' is slightly compressed, and A5 needs restrained delivery to keep its emotional hesitation natural. No rewrite needed.\",\n      \"alternativeComparison\": \"The preserved alternative follows a former service representative helping a refund claimant through a failing process. This version makes A the displaced member and B the intermediary carrying out the club's decision, giving the old promise a personal cost.\",\n      \"accept\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"S184-single-b\",\n      \"candidateHash\": \"90004ccbf8d8594f52634f583b78f0dbc21f24039417761b621e805c6d863691\",\n      \"secondPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\n            \"score\": 5,\n            \"evidence\": \"A1 explicitly wants to prevent injury; A3 converts putting a foot down into a checklist item, and A5 creates separate approvals and a walking-only exception.\"\n          },\n          \"responseLogic\": {\n            \"score\": 5,\n            \"evidence\": \"B2 supplies the foot-down response that A3 subdivides; B4's 'whichever side' causes A5 to require practice and sign-off on both sides.\"\n          },\